Subject: Exploded Cantor M2B Supplied Entry Stability Reconciliation

Description: Seven-fold SJS expansion of the preserved source for a strict pure transform that independently assembles caller-supplied pre-read and post-read entry records, compares a closed entry-local field set, and releases one inspectable stable pair or one typed fault without claiming physical time or provenance.

