& [CrossWeaveTrace] joins existing fabric
  + [assembly] supplies the only nested admission path and exact observation vocabulary
  + [entry_policy] is transitively revalidated through each nested assembly
  + [stream_parser_vocabulary] is transitively revalidated through each nested assembly
