  + [fold_4_relations] cross-weaves assembly, RacePolicy, content-read, physical producer, and traversal boundaries
  + [fold_4_gain_delta] dependency order prevents unsafe-code semantic leakage
  + [fold_5_constraints] preserves sixteen source, identity, comparison, output, and effect guards
  + [fold_5_gain_delta] every admitted observation field is accounted or separately gated
  + [fold_6_failures] exposes fifteen invalidation paths and five concrete repairs
  + [fold_6_gain_delta] first-difference and nested-side faults become deterministic
  + [fold_7_proof] binds twelve verification gates, rollback, and downstream stop rules
